-- words --
A runner changes the kept model in its own commit: the Hypothesis commit itself adds the rule NewRule to the kept model in goals/model/, and a variant config of the Goal names NewRule; hyp run records the run, and hyp status G offers the select. The Probe prints what hyp run printed, then what hyp status printed.
-- run --
hyp status G-ONE --role runner
-- floor: contains --
hyp select G-ONE
-- ceiling --
other-goal-path
